---
import Layout from 'layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="mathcodes.org – Mathematics, All with Code">
  <main class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center items-center px-6 text-center bg-[#21252d] text-[#1b91d6]">
    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold mb-6 leading-tight">
      Mathematics,<br />
      Verified by Python.
    </h1>

    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mb-8 text-[#8ecae6]">
      Human-authored math challenges where only Python solutions count and every submission is checked by deterministic tests.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center">
      <a
        href="/daily-challenge"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-blue-200 text-blue-700 text-lg rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-300 transition font-semibold shadow-md"
      >
        <span class="text-xl">🧩</span>
        <span>Daily Code-Arrange</span>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/topics"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-[#1b91d6] text-white text-lg rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-400 transition font-semibold shadow-md"
      >
        <span class="text-xl">🚀</span>
        <span>Start Exploring</span>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/system-spec"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-transparent border border-blue-200 text-blue-200 text-lg rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-200 hover:text-blue-800 transition font-semibold"
      >
        <span class="text-xl">📜</span>
        <span>Read the System Rules</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <section class="bg-[#1a1d26] py-16 text-white text-center px-4">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">What is MathCodes?</h2>
    <p class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg text-gray-300">
      MathCodes is an open project designed to help you learn math through computation, visual intuition, and curiosity.
      Every problem is validated with Python—not prose—and follows a transparent specification.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[#282c34] py-16 px-4 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center">
      <div class="bg-[#1f2937] p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">📐 Visual Explanations</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-300">Understand math through diagrams, graphs, and interactive examples.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[#1f2937] p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">📘 Structured Notes</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-300">Explore carefully written Python notes on topics like calculus, differential equations, statistics and more.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[#1f2937] p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">💡 Code-Driven Learning</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-300">Solve human-authored problems by writing Python only—each submission is sandboxed and validated against deterministic tests.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[#1a1d26] py-16 px-4 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
      <div class="space-y-4 text-left">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-200">Flagship Hook</p>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold">Daily Code-Arrange Challenge</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-200">
          A Math Wordle for logic and math intuition. Drag shuffled Python blocks into the right order, tap Run, and see the
          pre-stored output. No sandboxing, no backend—just thinking like a mathematician with code.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-300 space-y-2">
          <li>Fresh puzzle every day with instant feedback.</li>
          <li>Zero backend compute: static JSON + client-side drag-and-drop.</li>
          <li>Shareable wins that build streaks and community momentum.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="flex gap-3 flex-wrap">
          <a
            href="/daily-challenge"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 bg-blue-200 text-blue-800 text-lg rounded-xl font-semibold shadow-md"
          >
            <span class="text-xl">🧩</span>
            <span>Play today's puzzle</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/system-spec"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 bg-transparent border border-blue-200 text-blue-100 text-lg rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-200 hover:text-blue-800 transition font-semibold"
          >
            <span class="text-xl">🔒</span>
            <span>See the zero-backend model</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#111827] border border-[#223455] rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl space-y-3">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-blue-200">Today's teaser</p>
        <h4 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Arrange the blocks to evaluate lim<sub>x→0</sub> sin(x)/x</h4>
        <div class="space-y-2 bg-[#0e1422] border border-[#2c3f64] rounded-xl p-4 text-left text-gray-200">
          <p class="text-sm text-blue-200">Shuffled blocks</p>
          <pre class="bg-[#0c111d] border border-[#1e2d4a] rounded-lg text-blue-100 text-sm p-3 overflow-x-auto">return result
result = sp.limit(expr, x, 0)
x = sp.symbols('x')
expr = sp.sin(x) / x
import sympy as sp</pre>
          <p class="text-sm text-blue-200">Clicking Run shows the stored output: <strong class="text-white">1.0</strong></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="bg-[#121417] text-gray-500 py-6 text-sm text-center">
    Built with ❤️ by Ashiful • <a href="mailto:ashiful@mathcodes.org" class="underline">ashiful@mathcodes.org</a>
  </footer>
</Layout>
